id: teleport-remote
name: Teleport Remote
kind: gear
# A Special Basic Item: only the ARC hands it out, and nothing crafts it.
special: true
# "Upon gaining this Special Item, a Character is assigned with this."
assignsCharacter: true
# "By spending 1 Action, you may either move to a Square of your choice adjacent to that
# Character, or move that Character to a Square of your choice adjacent to you."
placeCost: 1
teleports: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Tied to one Character. For an Action, go to them or bring them to you.
text: >
  Teleport Remote: Via this magical device, you are able to teleport yourself directly to a
  specific person, or teleport that person to you.
  –Effects: Upon gaining this Special Item, a Character is assigned with this. By spending 1
  Action, you may either move to a Square of your choice adjacent to that Character, or move
  that Character to a Square of your choice adjacent to you.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Given: the Character it is assigned to is picked among the world's characters, and can be
# changed on the Item.
#
# Teleport: 1 Action, the choice of going to them or bringing them, and a line at the table
# saying which.
#
# --- What the table keeps ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The move itself. This system moves nobody: which adjacent Square, and moving the tokens
# there, are the player's.
